cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use POK-Agent in research, please cite it as below."
title: "POK-Agent: a System 1 and System 2 computer-use agent for Windows"
abstract: >-
  POK-Agent is a Windows computer-use harness in which a large language model
  plans (System 2) and a small, fast decision model carries out bounded
  on-screen steps (System 1). Verified runs are stored as motor programs that
  System 1 replays for repeated tasks, reducing planner calls over time. The
  repository includes a Windows Agent Arena evaluation suite.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "KNY Industries"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Acekorneya/POK-Agent"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - computer use
  - AI agents
  - desktop automation
  - System 1 and System 2
  - JEV
  - Laya
  - Windows Agent Arena
